<title>USA: FGIC qualifies three issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies three issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said it has qualified for bond insurance the following three municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Washington Elementary School District #6, Ariz., School Improvement, $34.825 million.</p>
<p>--Gloucester, Mass., General Obligations (GOs), $14.575 million.</p>
<p>--Rockland County, N.Y., $19.8 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
